# Controls what `vercel` CLI deploys upload from this machine.
#
# This file exists for one load-bearing reason: when it is absent, the CLI
# falls back to .gitignore, which excludes dist/ — so the compiled output of
# the workspace packages never uploaded, and deployed functions could only
# get @college-events/* code from whatever Vercel's remote build cache had
# (which turned out to be a stale first-deploy build, frozen while every
# source-level fix was invisibly ignored). With this file present, dist/ is
# deliberately NOT ignored: build locally, and the deploy carries exactly
# the code you built.
#
# Because .gitignore no longer applies to uploads, secrets and junk must be
# excluded here explicitly.
node_modules
.git
.next
.vercel
.turbo
coverage
storage
*.log
*.tsbuildinfo
.DS_Store
.env
.env.*
